WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.080
[The illegal serve guy]

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.080
You can't read my serves, can you?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.220
So you want to play like that?

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.340
[The edge guy]

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.700
[The screamer guy]

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:13.840
[The high toss guy]

00:01:14.380 --> 00:01:15.760
I have been working on my new serve.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.100
I will go to the toilet quickly.

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:28.880
Just in time!

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:33.880
I think that I need to throw the ball a bit higher!

00:01:34.700 --> 00:01:36.480
[The non moving guy]

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.620
Nothing I can do about that!

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.280
[The perfect ball guy]

00:02:02.980 --> 00:02:03.640
It's not round!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.440
No, it does not sound good.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.220
[The Pongfinity guy]

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:38.320
Can we play seriously now?

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:40.180
C'mon! One more!

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.360
That's a Pongfinity shot!

00:02:50.460 --> 00:02:51.560
The jackpot guy!

